    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@64816",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LUCETTA.\nAlas, the way is wearisome and long.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@64816/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@64816/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 45,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6546126,
        "end": 6546201,
        "line": 245436,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@64816",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LUCETTA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@64895",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JULIA.\nA true-devoted pilgrim is not weary\nTo measure kingdoms with his feeble steps;\nMuch less shall she that hath Love’s wings to fly,\nAnd when the flight is made to one so dear,\nOf such divine perfection, as Sir Proteus.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@64895/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@64895/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 42,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@64895/line-3",
          "start": 43,
          "end": 85,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@64895/line-4",
          "start": 86,
          "end": 136,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@64895/line-5",
          "start": 137,
          "end": 180,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@64895/line-6",
          "start": 181,
          "end": 223,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6546205,
        "end": 6546478,
        "line": 245441,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@64895",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JULIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65172",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LUCETTA.\nBetter forbear till Proteus make return.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65172/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65172/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 49,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6546482,
        "end": 6546561,
        "line": 245450,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@65172",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LUCETTA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65255",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JULIA.\nO, know’st thou not his looks are my soul’s food?\nPity the dearth that I have pined in\nBy longing for that food so long a time.\nDidst thou but know the inly touch of love\nThou wouldst as soon go kindle fire with snow\nAs seek to quench the fire of love with words.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65255/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65255/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 56,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65255/line-3",
          "start": 57,
          "end": 93,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65255/line-4",
          "start": 94,
          "end": 134,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65255/line-5",
          "start": 135,
          "end": 177,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65255/line-6",
          "start": 178,
          "end": 223,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65255/line-7",
          "start": 224,
          "end": 270,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6546565,
        "end": 6546890,
        "line": 245455,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@65255",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JULIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65584",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LUCETTA.\nI do not seek to quench your love’s hot fire,\nBut qualify the fire’s extreme rage,\nLest it should burn above the bounds of reason.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65584/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65584/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 54,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65584/line-3",
          "start": 55,
          "end": 91,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65584/line-4",
          "start": 92,
          "end": 139,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6546894,
        "end": 6547073,
        "line": 245465,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@65584",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LUCETTA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65767",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JULIA.\nThe more thou damm’st it up, the more it burns.\nThe current that with gentle murmur glides,\nThou know’st, being stopped, impatiently doth rage;\nBut when his fair course is not hindered,\nHe makes sweet music with th’ enamelled stones,\nGiving a gentle kiss to every sedge\nHe overtaketh in his pilgrimage;\nAnd so by many winding nooks he strays\nWith willing sport to the wild ocean.\nThen let me go and hinder not my course.\nI’ll be as patient as a gentle stream\nAnd make a pastime of each weary step\nTill the last step have brought me to my love,\nAnd there I’ll rest as after much turmoil\nA blessed soul doth in Elysium.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65767/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@65767/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 54,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
