    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67088",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LUCETTA.\nWhat fashion, madam, shall I make your breeches?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67088/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67088/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 57,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6548398,
        "end": 6548485,
        "line": 245517,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@67088",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LUCETTA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67179",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JULIA.\nThat fits as well as “Tell me, good my lord,\nWhat compass will you wear your farthingale?”\nWhy e’en what fashion thou best likes, Lucetta.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67179/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67179/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 51,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67179/line-3",
          "start": 52,
          "end": 97,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67179/line-4",
          "start": 98,
          "end": 145,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6548489,
        "end": 6548674,
        "line": 245522,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@67179",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JULIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67368",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LUCETTA.\nYou must needs have them with a codpiece, madam.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67368/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67368/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 57,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6548678,
        "end": 6548765,
        "line": 245529,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@67368",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LUCETTA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67459",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JULIA.\nOut, out, Lucetta, that will be ill-favoured.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67459/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67459/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6548769,
        "end": 6548851,
        "line": 245534,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@67459",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JULIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67545",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LUCETTA.\nA round hose, madam, now’s not worth a pin\nUnless you have a codpiece to stick pins on.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67545/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67545/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 51,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67545/line-3",
          "start": 52,
          "end": 96,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6548855,
        "end": 6548986,
        "line": 245539,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@67545",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LUCETTA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67680",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JULIA.\nLucetta, as thou lov’st me, let me have\nWhat thou think’st meet and is most mannerly.\nBut tell me, wench, how will the world repute me\nFor undertaking so unstaid a journey?\nI fear me it will make me scandalized.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67680/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67680/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 46,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67680/line-3",
          "start": 47,
          "end": 92,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67680/line-4",
          "start": 93,
          "end": 141,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67680/line-5",
          "start": 142,
          "end": 179,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67680/line-6",
          "start": 180,
          "end": 218,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6548990,
        "end": 6549258,
        "line": 245545,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@67680",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JULIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67952",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LUCETTA.\nIf you think so, then stay at home and go not.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67952/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@67952/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 55,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6549262,
        "end": 6549347,
        "line": 245554,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@67952",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LUCETTA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68041",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JULIA.\nNay, that I will not.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68041/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68041/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 28,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6549351,
        "end": 6549409,
        "line": 245559,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@68041",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JULIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68103",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LUCETTA.\nThen never dream on infamy, but go.\nIf Proteus like your journey when you come,\nNo matter who’s displeased when you are gone.\nI fear me he will scarce be pleased withal.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68103/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68103/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 44,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68103/line-3",
          "start": 45,
          "end": 88,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68103/line-4",
          "start": 89,
          "end": 134,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68103/line-5",
          "start": 135,
          "end": 178,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6549413,
        "end": 6549636,
        "line": 245564,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@68103",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LUCETTA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68330",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JULIA.\nThat is the least, Lucetta, of my fear.\nA thousand oaths, an ocean of his tears,\nAnd instances of infinite of love,\nWarrant me welcome to my Proteus.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68330/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68330/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 46,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68330/line-3",
          "start": 47,
          "end": 87,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68330/line-4",
          "start": 88,
          "end": 122,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68330/line-5",
          "start": 123,
          "end": 156,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6549640,
        "end": 6549841,
        "line": 245572,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@68330",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JULIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68535",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LUCETTA.\nAll these are servants to deceitful men.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68535/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68535/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 49,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6549845,
        "end": 6549924,
        "line": 245580,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@68535",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LUCETTA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68618",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JULIA.\nBase men that use them to so base effect!\nBut truer stars did govern Proteus’ birth.\nHis words are bonds, his oaths are oracles,\nHis love sincere, his thoughts immaculate,\nHis tears pure messengers sent from his heart,\nHis heart as far from fraud as heaven from earth.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68618/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68618/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 48,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68618/line-3",
          "start": 49,
          "end": 91,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68618/line-4",
          "start": 92,
          "end": 135,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68618/line-5",
          "start": 136,
          "end": 178,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68618/line-6",
          "start": 179,
          "end": 225,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68618/line-7",
          "start": 226,
          "end": 275,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6549928,
        "end": 6550258,
        "line": 245585,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@68618",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JULIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68952",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LUCETTA.\nPray heav’n he prove so when you come to him.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68952/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@68952/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 54,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6550262,
        "end": 6550346,
        "line": 245595,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@68952",
        "anchor": "sceneII_37.7"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LUCETTA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@69040",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JULIA.\nNow, as thou lov’st me, do him not that wrong\nTo bear a hard opinion of his truth.\nOnly deserve my love by loving him.\nAnd presently go with me to my chamber\nTo take a note of what I stand in need of\nTo furnish me upon my longing journey.\nAll that is mine I leave at thy dispose,\nMy goods, my lands, my reputation;\nOnly, in lieu thereof, dispatch me hence.\nCome, answer not, but to it presently.\nI am impatient of my tarriance.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@69040/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@69040/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@69040/line-3",
          "start": 53,
          "end": 89,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@69040/line-4",
          "start": 90,
          "end": 125,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@69040/line-5",
          "start": 126,
          "end": 164,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneII_37.7/p@69040/line-6",
